<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  6.36%			 C/S = 3.18%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  6.79%			 O/N = 2.54%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  7.64%			 T/N = 5.93%</p>
<p>		   Dec  13, 1996			Dec  12, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  7.46%	1 month forward =  7.45%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  7.47%	2 month forward =  7.29%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.58%	3 month forward =  7.45%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.81%	4 month forward =  7.79%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.74%	5 month forward =  7.79%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.48%	6 month forward =  7.52%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
